{"articleNo":"195843","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=195843&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"매월 4일은 안전점검의 날","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.08.06","hit":"5441","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>「</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>안전점검의 날</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이란</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1994</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 성수대교 붕괴사고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 1995</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 삼풍백화점 붕괴사고 등 대형 재난이 발생함에 따라 우리 사회 곳곳에 상존하고 있는 안전 불감증을 청산하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민 스스로 안전의 중요성을 인식하여 위험요인을 한달에 한번이라도 안전을 점검하는 습관을 생활 속에서 실천하기 위해 시작되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">안전문화운동의 일환으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’96. 4. 4.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부터 행정 시책으로 실시해오다 그 중요성을 강화하기 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2004</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 '</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재난 및 안전관리 기본법'</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 따라 법적 행사로 시행하게 되었는데요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">매월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일을 안전점검의 날로 지정한 이유는</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">』</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 불길한 숫자라고 생각하는 국민들의 미신적인 마인드를 해소하기 위함이라고 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일이 공휴일 또는 일요일인 경우 그 다음 평일에 실시하도록 하고 있어 이번달은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">6</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일이 안전점검의 날입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">오늘 안전점검의 날을 맞아 화재 위험 요인은 없는지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전기 코드 등은 멀쩡한지 등 연구실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사무실 등 우리 주변의 위험요소는 없는지 한번 살펴보시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">8</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월의 안전 주제는 심폐소생술 및 심장자동충격기 사용법 등 응급처치 요령입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우리대학교 테크노관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">글로벌관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">디지털관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공동실험실습관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개의 건물에는 각 층 엘리베이터 인근에 심장자동충격기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공기호흡기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">화재대피마스크 등을 상시 비치해 두고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">무심코 지나치기 보다 관심을 갖고 한번 살펴만 보더라도 비상 시 유용하게 사용될 수 있을거라 생각합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이번달에는 심폐소생술 및 심장자동충격기 사용법에 대한 동영상을 링크하였으니 많은 참고 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><font color=\"#666666\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p></font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><a href=\"http://ov01-ip3798.ktics.co.kr/life/LIFECYCLE_shock.mp4\"></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><a href=\"http://ov01-ip3798.ktics.co.kr/life/LIFECYCLE_shock.mp4\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응급처치 요령</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">무의식</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">쇼크 등</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)_</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">출처 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민안전방송</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><a href=\"http://ov01-ip3798.ktics.co.kr/safe/%EC%8B%AC%ED%8F%90%EC%86%8C%EC%83%9D%EC%88%A0%20%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%B8%ED%8E%B8.mp4\"><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #800080; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">심폐소생술</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #800080; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">_</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #800080; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민안전방송</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"COLOR: #800080; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><a href=\"http://ov01-ip3798.ktics.co.kr/safe/%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%AC%EC%9E%A5%EC%B6%A9%EA%B2%A9%EA%B8%B0%20%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95.mp4\"></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><a href=\"http://ov01-ip3798.ktics.co.kr/safe/%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%AC%EC%9E%A5%EC%B6%A9%EA%B2%A9%EA%B8%B0%20%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95.mp4\"><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #800080; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자동심장충격기 사용법</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #800080; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">_</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #800080; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민안전방송</span></u></a></p></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
